This library is built against, and contains no file of, the Wilson Yang–Mills
source distribution (repository yang-mills-group/OpenAI-YM-20261028, commit
3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464), whose project licence is the Apache
License, Version 2.0, and whose NOTICE supplies its attributions.

Several proofs in this library follow proof text of that distribution:
  PDTAdapters/Divergence.lean, conformal_divergence: the proof of
    YM.Work.A01.divergence.
  PDTAdapters/General.lean, conformal_divergenceIn, smooth_consIn, D_consIn:
    the same proof and its supporting steps, with moments read in a second
    table.
  PDTAdapters/TraceStep.lean, selected_axis_shape: the proof of the
    distribution's axis_shape; the rate hypothesis of selected_dilation_rate
    and selected_dilation_not_conserved is the text of the distribution's
    HeadlineSpec.lean, line 93, with a real constant in place of its award.
The statements and the remaining proofs are this library's.
